{
  "$meta": {
    "product": "Conts ERP",
    "version": "1.2",
    "source": "The Conts Digital Brand Guide v1.0 (16 Sep 2026), extended to the token depth of houzs-erp/src/lib/ui-tokens.ts and hookka-erp/src/app/globals.css",
    "themeSelector": "[data-theme=\"theconts\"]",
    "stylesheet": "tokens.css",
    "rules": [
      "Nothing outside tokens.css hard-codes a brand value.",
      "Gold is identity, selection and premium emphasis only. It is never a status colour.",
      "Status is never communicated by colour alone — always pair with a text label.",
      "Each semantic state has three roles: tint background, -fg for TEXT (>= 4.5:1), -line for dots, borders and fills (3:1).",
      "Gold TEXT on light surfaces uses gold-700 (#8A6A2F, 5.01:1). gold-500 is 2.34:1 and fails AA.",
      "All contrast ratios in this file were computed with the WCAG relative-luminance formula, not estimated.",
      "PROVISIONAL values are replaced centrally when original brand artwork is supplied.",
      "Text on the dark shell uses #DEDAD3 or #8A8680. Never a white alpha — rgba(255,255,255,0.3) on #121110 is 2.7:1 and fails AA.",
      "No authored font-size below the 11px micro step. Micro is for badges and labels only."
    ],
    "siblingThemes": {
      "houzs-erp": {
        "primary": "#0F766E",
        "dark": "#0A1F2E",
        "page": "#F4F7F7",
        "font": "Tahoma"
      },
      "hookka-erp": {
        "primary": "#6B5C32",
        "dark": "#1F1D1B",
        "page": "#F0ECE9",
        "font": "IBM Plex Sans"
      },
      "theconts": {
        "primary": "#C8A46A",
        "dark": "#151515",
        "page": "#FAF9F6",
        "font": "IBM Plex Sans"
      }
    }
  },
